<title>USA: TABLE - Allegiance Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Allegiance Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MCGAW PARK, Ill. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2		Six Months</p>
<p>				    1997     1996     1997	1996</p>
<p> Net Sales		   $1,075.0 $1,089.9 $2,130.9  $2,202.0</p>
<p>Costs and Expenses</p>
<p>     Cost of goods sold     851.6    860.4  1,687.7   1,747.6</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>     administrative	   161.8    176.9    322.8     344.9</p>
<p>     Research &amp; development   2.4	2.1	4.4	 4.1</p>
<p>     Goodwill amortization    5.4	9.2     10.7	18.4</p>
<p>     Interest expense	  17.4     22.5     36.3	45.0</p>
<p>     Other (income) expense   2.2	0.2	2.4     (0.8)</p>
<p>     Total costs,expenses 1,040.8  1,071.3  2,064.3   2,159.2</p>
<p> Income before income taxes  34.2     18.6     66.6	42.8</p>
<p>     Income tax expense	12.2	6.8     23.6	15.9</p>
<p> Net Income			22.0     11.8     43.0	26.9</p>
<p> Earnings per common share   0.39     0.21     0.77	0.49</p>
<p> Average shares		  56.7     54.9     56.1	54.9</p>
<p>		 (in millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago results pro forma. Allegiance was spun off from Baxter International Inc in September 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
